3.1 Physical Space

\mathcal{X}(N_H) \subseteq \mathbb{R}^m

The set of all physically representable configurations for population N_H.

3.2 Feasible Space

\mathcal{F}_D(N_H) \subseteq \mathcal{X}(N_H)

