Y(N_H) = J(\mathcal{F}_D(N_H)) \\
\downarrow \\
\mathcal{P}_{\text{Pareto}} = \text{NonDominated}(Y(N_H))
\end{array}

The Pareto frontier is a property of the objective image, not of the feasible set directly.

