For each subsystem, we provide uncertainty bounds:

X_{\text{dest}} \in [X_{\text{low}}, X_{\text{high}}]

with 90% confidence. The feasibility problem then becomes robust:

\mathcal{F}_{D,X}^{\text{robust}} = \{V : X_{\text{dest}}^{\text{high}}(V) \leq X_{\max}\}.

